WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.707
Oh, what time is it?

2
00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:07.658
Is Nancy up already?

3
00:00:07.659 --> 00:00:13.398
No, she isn't.

4
00:00:13.399 --> 00:00:16.860
"Woof! Woof! Nancy! Nancy!

5
00:00:16.861 --> 00:00:19.021
Time to get up!"

6
00:00:19.022 --> 00:00:22.571
"Okay! Okay! I am getting up."

7
00:00:22.572 --> 00:00:28.263
Every morning, I must wake her up.

8
00:00:28.264 --> 00:00:33.059
It is fun to watch Nancy brush her teeth.

9
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:36.620
"Woof! Woof! Time to get dressed!"

10
00:00:36.621 --> 00:00:38.761
Nancy puts on a skirt.

11
00:00:38.762 --> 00:00:44.663
Nancy pulls on socks too.

12
00:00:44.664 --> 00:00:47.769
"Muffy! Where is my schoolbag?"

13
00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:49.721
"What?"

14
00:00:49.722 --> 00:00:52.183
Nancy looks in her closet.

15
00:00:52.184 --> 00:00:54.368
I look under the desk.

16
00:00:54.369 --> 00:00:59.522
I find her bag under the desk. "Woof! Woof!"

17
00:00:59.523 --> 00:01:02.938
"Woof! Woof! Time to eat now!"

18
00:01:02.939 --> 00:01:05.553
Nancy eats a piece of toast.

19
00:01:05.554 --> 00:01:08.932
I eat my breakfast too.

20
00:01:08.933 --> 00:01:14.053
"Hurry! Here comes the school bus! Woof! Woof!"

21
00:01:14.054 --> 00:01:16.598
"Woof! Woof! Nancy!

22
00:01:16.599 --> 00:01:18.707
Don't forget your cap!"

23
00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:23.664
Whew! She always forgets something!

24
00:01:23.665 --> 00:01:28.135
But my job is not done yet.

25
00:01:28.136 --> 00:01:30.896
I must clean up her mess.

26
00:01:30.897 --> 00:01:36.339
Hmm. But I am a bit sleepy now.

27
00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.159
I will take a nap.

28
00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:44.861
I need to rest until Nancy comes back.

